inverse.ts adapts the numeric lookup-table, generic matrix and AArch64 NEON
rounding paths from libswscale/yuv2rgb.c, output.c,
aarch64/swscale_unscaled.c and aarch64/yuv2rgb_neon.S at the same pinned commit.

