This component is also LGPL-2.1-or-later. Its adaptation emulates instruction
rounding in portable TypeScript, retains fractional chroma through the matrix,
and rejects a measured nondeterministic default semiplanar reference path.
It does not execute FFmpeg or host SIMD instructions.

The x86_64 inverse profile additionally adapts signed multiply-high arithmetic,
packed-output dispatch, approximate chroma interpolation and the final-two-row
C fallback from libswscale/x86/swscale_template.c, x86/swscale.c, swscale.c and
vscale.c at the same pinned commit.

