component-resize.ts additionally follows the paired RGB chroma decision in
libswscale/utils.c at the pinned commit, using floor-shifted destination width
before allocating ceil-sized chroma planes. It retains LGPL-2.1-or-later and
the Michael Niedermayer attribution above.

src/interpolation/ adds neighbor, bilinear and area resize axes and bounded shared
execution. Axis modules retain the original libswscale/utils.c authors and pinned
commit in their headers; see src/interpolation/NOTICE.activation and
LICENSES/LGPL-2.1-or-later.txt. Public conversion and PixelResizeError identity are
shared with the existing implementation. No full swscale conformance is certified.


inverse-coefficients.ts additionally retains the limited-range YUV matrix
coefficient tables and fixed-point initialization from libswscale/yuv2rgb.c
at the same pinned commit. The adaptation shares coefficient profiles across
lookup-table, filtered, SIMD-emulated and combined resize output paths.

